---
title: "fscript output to a file or pipeline"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Checking the output path
  s1: Writing the transcript to the pipeline
  s2: Output failed
  s3: Preparing the replacement transcript
  s4: Pipeline command completed
  s5: Transcript saved, reporting its location
  s6: Transcript saved, completion reporting failed
  s7: Transcript saved
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s0 --> s2: the save fails
  s0 --> s3: the destination can be used
  s1 --> s4: the downstream command closes the pipe or the transcript is delivered
  s1 --> s2: output reports an error
  s3 --> s2: the save fails
  s3 --> s5: the completed transcript replaces the destination
  s5 --> s6: the saved path cannot be resolved or output reports an error
  s5 --> s7: completion is reported
